{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A themed set of equipment, interior items, and dyes inspired by Ihm, the beloved mascot of Elnea Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interiors are available at Flower Land in Yano Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other items can be purchased at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St. and at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbInterior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Flower Land in Yano Market.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White Jumbo Stuffed Ihm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ihm Knapsack, Child's Ihm Knapsack, Ihm Ear Earmuffs, Ihm-Ihm Hat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ihm Bow Tie: Gingham Blue, Ihm Bow Tie: Red</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbDye</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available at Caravan Co. in Old Town Riverside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ihm Color: Lavender</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021490?t=1762336814","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021490?t=1762336814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a